+// MA-N FROM THE DOM, at the arm `RING_GEOMETRY` ships (MRK-ABS's G-ABS-7/8; T9-B29). Every cell of
+// 16×16, 9×9 and 4×4: the ring's painted outer ink — each vertex of its `d` through the path's own
